"id": "790462812150344", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031458_790462815483677_5380930595172148371_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6eE5c3kpXlwQ7kNvwEnSoTW&_nc_oc=Adr8dJk_mL69St4ZzKbaR0qWAihte4OlnmvaUWpWMVl_eZ_-ouscvElr88bVB_y2aZo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHDXAIeYHrMaMldbdl42oWwOGMa-DHm1Z3rJkcFwO1fhw&oe=6A8C3551"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot2.png", "id": "850077762573200", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031634_850077769239866_7313417490599216593_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uacs11IwIk4Q7kNvwEmLT1m&_nc_oc=AdrZ0d60qp4QVlUiXpblvtf_g1tfQQl5YyKBjTSfYRbXZhomo6dyFD7RBofOOUjr43Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEu9wch7a9Xu12c9JEols6YuZ1gUx1NjP1Uys7D_JmNhw&oe=6A8C2E2B"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "1514223109014213", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001667_1514223119014212_7927654477935769634_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p6lLh91J3wkQ7kNvwH4Hl9H&_nc_oc=AdqDB4NFzgQKmWHLbduNUVd3iu4acIalN5AU-ZGV-zyW-UBmuNuN_QGBVTAmOK8gE3I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQETxiboOT9FCjDBWwx5No50m69qHDAb5-FgnXr3_u0gMQ&oe=6A8C40E7"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "1118439258797246", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001667_1118439262130579_1516651612606432838_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XF2IIGclfT4Q7kNvwE9eU-P&_nc_oc=AdoP8FHU7-VThC19JVYnyIeZBRqDtnY-kT75xBmR1T6-qdTSloBU2o0-IOI4CoW3c-s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF0UtuAZkq-A0thOd5mY6y5TwYSmzHDX2T_VAM24o8aBA&oe=6A8C2C6A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLandscape.png", "id": "3147257625535224", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974593_3147257628868557_5914689202831265680_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nKzoPjZEwUAQ7kNvwE_bAm7&_nc_oc=Adpv50hsU0InCBcen5GAuoGo2XNsbwsRHH_D0wDQyoN1OXRXv9ybDXF4daUErFOcxZs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHTe0TWPloE0UN3hAkgA4fOsfh6Ci-jB30WVAK4rD0Zdg&oe=6A8C3D21"}, "display_name": "3D scan of a ruin in a forest", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Move like a pedestrian in a ruin surrounded by a forest, reconstructed from videos taken by a helmet-held 360 camera, whose trajectory is about 400m long.\n\nRight controller:\n- Rotate on the left or right by using the joystick\n- Update the vertical offset (up or down) by using the joystick\n- Choose a location and teleport to it by using the virtual laser pointer\n- Teleport by using the index trigger only if the laser is green (not red)\n\nLeft controller:\n- Move continuously by using the joystick\n- Switch pannel and map by using the grip/hand trigger\n- If both map and pannel are disabled, switch between rendering modes (texturing or normal colors) by pressing the index trigger\n- The map shows the cloud of mesh vertices and the user location\n- If the pannel is enabled, switch between constrained and unconstrained motions by pressing the index trigger\n- The constrained motion controls your height above the ground\n- The pannel shows information about the 3D model and the selected motion.\n", "short_description": "Move continuously like a pedestrian in a ruin surrounded by a forest, which was computed by photogrammetry from a cubemap video (4096x1344x2) taken by a helmet-held 360 camera (Gopro Max) and by walking about 400 meters."}]}, "developer_name": "Maxime Lhuillier", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/PrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unity 2019.4", "support_website_url": "http://maxime.lhuillier.free.fr/", "website_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_